Description: modern photo and video gallery for GNOME
 Picnest automatically finds every photo and video on all internal drives
 and mounted external drives and shows them in one organized library.
 .
 Features include a fast mixed grid for very large libraries, days, months
 and years views, favorites, albums, folders, memories, smart
 collections for screenshots, panoramas and duplicates,
 instant search with filters, a full screen viewer with EXIF details,
 a video player with speed control and picture-in-picture, a basic photo
 editor, a password protected hidden album and a trash with automatic
 cleanup.
